  "notes": "USAGE: スピーチ is commonly used for speeches at events like weddings, ceremonies, and competitions.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- スピーチ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ (to give a speech)\n- スピーチ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{頼|たの}む→頼む：01104_tanomu⟧ (to ask someone to give a speech)\n- ⟦スピーチコンテスト→スピーチコンテスト：noentry⟧ (speech contest)\n- ⟦{乾杯|かんぱい}→乾杯：00176_kanpai⟧⟦の→の：09472_no⟧スピーチ (toast speech)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{演説|えんぜつ}→演説：01894_enzetsu⟧ (public speech, usually political)\n- ⟦{挨拶|あいさつ}→挨拶：02505_aisatsu⟧ (greeting speech, remarks)\n- ⟦{講演|こうえん}→講演：02735_kouen⟧ (lecture)\n- ⟦{発表|はっぴょう}→発表：03562_happyou⟧ (presentation)",
